Recommends: virt-viewer, ovmf, swtpm, swtpm-tools, gstreamer1.0-pulseaudio
Description: Native GNOME virtual machine manager
 Pirwa manages local libvirt virtual machines with a native GTK 4 and
 libadwaita interface, embedded and detached SPICE consoles, and explicit
 resource and storage controls.
